      "E": {
        "slot": "E",
        "id": "TristanaE",
        "name": "Explosive Charge",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "When Tristana kills a unit, her cannonballs burst into shrapnel, dealing damage to surrounding enemies. Can be activated to place a bomb on a target enemy that explodes after a short duration dealing damage to surrounding units.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive: </span>Tristana's Attacks that kill enemies deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(45/60/75/90/105 + (25% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to surrounding enemies.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Tristana attaches a bomb to an enemy or turret that deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(60/85/110/135/160 + (80% bonus Attack Damage) + (50% Ability Power)) physical damage</span> to surrounding enemies after 4 seconds. The damage is increased by 25% each time Tristana hits an Attack or Ability (max 4 stacks).<br /><br />At 4 stacks, the bomb explodes immediately (max <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(120/170/220/270/320 + (160% bonus Attack Damage) + (100% Ability Power)) physical damage</span>).<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Active damage is increased by Critical Strike Chance and Critical Strike Damage at 40% effectiveness.<br />The detonation radius is twice as large if used on a turret.</span>",
